post_install() {
  cat <<'MSG'
==> RasterizedDB: set a password before starting the service:
      sudoedit /etc/rasterizeddb/rasterizeddb.env    (RASTERIZEDDB_PG_PASSWORD=...)
      sudo systemctl enable --now rasterizeddb
    Data lives in /var/lib/rasterizeddb. It listens on localhost only
    (PostgreSQL protocol 5432, native 61170); RASTERIZEDDB_ARGS in the same
    file adds server flags, e.g. --pg-addr 0.0.0.0.
MSG
}
